  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU over RS-485: 1-8-N-2 by default (also N-1, E-1, O-1), 9600 to 115200 bd (factory 38400), address 1 to 247 (factory 1), up to 32 nodes. Parameterised with Belimo Assistant 2.",
    "The flow registers come in several units (l/s, gpm and a selected unit). The selected-unit values use the scaling 0.001; the manual lists the selectable-unit range per unit.",
    "Each device may limit the values to a narrower range than the manual shows (see the datasheet).",
    "All registers are holding registers (functions 3 and 6; 4, 2 and 16 also accepted). The manual numbers registers from 1 (No.) and from 0 (Address); the Address column is used here (address base 0).",
    "32-bit values take two consecutive registers, least significant word first.",
    "A register not supported by the device or its settings reads 65535.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's register description; not tested on a device."
  ],
